  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "槍の如き　針と　凶暴なる　気質にて海鬼の　異名を　持つ　ポケモン。毒を　すすりて　己の　糧とす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "창과 같은 침과 흉포한 성질 때문에 “바다 도깨비”라는 이명이 있는 포켓몬. 독을 마셔서 자신의 양식으로 삼는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身上如同槍尖般的針以及凶暴的性情使這種寶可夢得到了海鬼的外號。會吞下毒物作為己身糧食。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses épines semblables à des lances et sa nature violente lui valent le sobriquet « d’ogre des océans ». Il se repaît du poison qu’il aspire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein brutales Wesen sowie die speergleichen Stacheln haben ihm den Beinamen „Meeresdämon“ beschert. Es schlürft Gift, das ihm als Nahrung dient.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus púas, afiladas como lanzas, y su violento carácter le han granjeado el mote de Demonio del Mar. Puede sorber veneno como sustento alimenticio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Appellato \"demone dei mari\" per via del feroce temperamento e degli aculei simili a lance, sugge veleno e indi lo converte in nutrimento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its lancelike spikes and savage temperament have earned it the nickname “sea fiend.” It slurps up poison to nourish itself.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "槍の如き　針と　凶暴なる　気質にて海鬼の　異名を　持つ　ポケモン。毒を　すすりて　己の　糧とす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身上如同枪尖般的针以及凶暴的性情使这种宝可梦得到了海鬼的外号。会吞下毒物作为自身粮食。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus púas, afiladas como lanzas, y su violento carácter le han granjeado el mote de Demonio del Mar. Puede sorber veneno como sustento alimenticio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ねむっているときでも　うごくものがちかづくと　どくばりが　むいしきにはんのうし　つきさしてくるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "잠들어 있는 동안에도 움직이는 물체가 접근하면 독침이 무의식적으로 반응해서 꿰뚫어 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "即使是在睡覺的時候，只要有會動的東西靠近，毒針就會反射性地刺向對方。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Même quand il dort, ses épines empoisonnées réagissent par réflexe à tout ce qui bouge et transpercent quiconque s’approche de trop près.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Selbst im Schlaf reagieren Myriadors Giftstacheln von allein und spießen alles auf, was sich ihm nähert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus púas tóxicas reaccionan como acto reflejo ante cualquier movimiento, por lo que ensartará todo lo que se acerque incluso mientras duerme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Qualunque cosa gli si avvicini viene trafitta dai suoi aculei velenosi, che reagiscono per riflesso anche mentre dorme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Overqwil’s poisonous spikes will reflexively react even while Overqwil sleeps, stabbing any moving thing that approaches.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "眠っているときでも　動くものが近づくと　毒針が　無意識に反応し　突き刺してくるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "即使在睡着的时候，只要有会动的东西接近，毒针就会无意识地作出反应刺过去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus púas tóxicas reaccionan como acto reflejo ante cualquier movimiento, por lo que ensartará todo lo que se acerque incluso mientras duerme.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きょうぼうで　きしょうが　あらい。どくばりの　せんたんは　ギザギザでささると　かんたんには　ぬけない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "흉포하고 성질이 사납다. 독침 끝에는 톱니가 있어서 찔리면 쉽게 뽑히지 않는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "凶狠且性格粗暴。毒針的前端呈鋸齒狀，被刺中就無法輕易拔出來。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est féroce et impulsif. Ses épines empoisonnées ont des extrémités dentelées. Une fois plantées, elles sont difficiles à retirer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist ungestüm und brutal. Die Spitzen seiner Giftstacheln sind gezackt, wodurch sie sich nach einem Stich nur schwer entfernen lassen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Posee un carácter feroz y agresivo. Las puntas de sus púas venenosas son dentadas, por lo que no resulta fácil extraerlas una vez que se clavan.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha un carattere feroce e violento. Le punte seghettate dei suoi aculei velenosi rendono difficile estrarli una volta conficcati.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s ferocious and has a short temper. The ends of its spikes are barbed, and they can’t be easily removed once they’ve punctured something.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "凶暴で　気性が　荒い。毒針の　先端は　ギザギザで刺さると　簡単には　抜けない。",
      "language": {
